  "body": "I believe there is a typo in the third sentence of the third paragraph of the spec's [introduction](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#introduction):\n\n`A Service exposes a collection of included Services and Characteristics.`\n\nAs far as I know a `Service` doesn't expose other `Services`. I believe it should read: `A Server exposes...`\n",
